Files copied verbatim (content unmodified; only the file names were
flattened to live in one directory):

  brand-voice-enforcement.SKILL.md   <- skills/brand-voice-enforcement/SKILL.md
  voice-constant-tone-flexes.md      <- skills/brand-voice-enforcement/references/voice-constant-tone-flexes.md
